<h1 class="greeting">Password Changed Successfully</h1>

<div class="alert alert-success">
    <strong>Confirmed:</strong> Your Vorkana password was successfully updated.
</div>

<p class="message">
    <strong>Change Details:</strong><br>
    • Time: {{timestamp}}<br>
    • IP Address: {{ipAddress}}<br>
    • Device: {{deviceInfo}}
</p>

{{#if isSecurityAlert}}
<div class="alert alert-danger" style="margin: 32px 0;">
    <strong>SECURITY ALERT</strong>
    <p style="margin-top: 8px;">
        If you didn't make this change:
    </p>
    <ol style="margin: 12px 0 0 20px;">
        <li>Contact our security team immediately</li>
        <li>Check your account for unauthorized activity</li>
        <li>Consider enabling two-factor authentication</li>
        <li>Review your recent login history</li>
    </ol>
</div>
{{/if}}

<div style="text-align: center; margin: 40px 0;">
    <a href="{{frontendUrl}}/account/security" class="btn">Review Security Settings</a>
</div>

<h3 style="color: #111827; margin: 32px 0 16px 0;">Security Recommendations</h3>

<ul class="features-list">
    <li><strong>Enable 2FA</strong> - Add an extra layer of security to your account</li>
    <li><strong>Use a password manager</strong> - Generate and store strong, unique passwords</li>
    <li><strong>Check login history</strong> - Regularly review devices that access your account</li>
    <li><strong>Log out unused devices</strong> - Revoke access from devices you no longer use</li>
    <li><strong>Be phishing-aware</strong> - Never share credentials via email or messages</li>
</ul>

<div style="background: #fef2f2; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 32px 0;">
    <h4 style="color: #991b1b; margin-bottom: 8px;">Immediate Action Required If:</h4>
    <ul style="color: #991b1b; margin: 8px 0 0 20px; font-size: 14px;">
        <li>You notice unfamiliar orders or messages</li>
        <li>Your profile information was changed without your knowledge</li>
        <li>You receive password reset emails you didn't request</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="color: #dc2626; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 12px; font-weight: 600;">
        Contact: <a href="mailto:security@vorkana.com" style="color: #dc2626;">security@vorkana.com</a>
    </p>
</div>

<p class="message" style="text-align: center; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 40px;">
    This is an automated security notification. Please do not reply.<br>
    For immediate security concerns, use the contact information above.
</p>